{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415346","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415346","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041534601:1":{"text":"봐, 여긴 완전히 달라졌군! 한겨울 축제 분위기로 가득해!","source_cn":"看，这里完全变了个模样！充满了隆冬节的氛围！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC75DF7E774A65119","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041534602:1":{"text":"한겨울 축제에 대한 전설을 들어본 적 있나, 탈렌?","source_cn":"你听说过他们对于隆冬节的传说吗，塔琳？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD75C9D1AA3D424C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041534603:1":{"text":"물론이지. 나는 낭만적이고 아름다운 이야기를 좋아해.","source_cn":"当然，我喜欢一切浪漫与美丽的故事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BDDE9F49156EF2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041534604:1":{"text":"증오로 가득 찬 악마가 대지를 저주하고, 이 세상을 끝없는 추위와 어둠에 빠뜨렸다지!","source_cn":"可憎的恶魔诅咒了大地，让世界陷入无尽的严寒与黑夜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AF368B5038E4561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041534605:1":{"text":"하지만 찬란한 별이 불꽃과 빛을 가지고 하늘에서 내려왔다고 해.","source_cn":"直到灿烂的星辰从天而降，带来了火焰与光明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D4D1C7DD789EDD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041534606:1":{"text":"정말 낭만적인 이야기야. 어릴 적 나의 꿈은 별이 되는 거였는데... 멋지지 않아?","source_cn":"多么浪漫的故事，我从小做梦都在想，如果我能化为那颗星星...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x563A7D29A3C9B529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041534607:1":{"text":"...음, 일반적으로 어린 시절 한겨울 축제에 비는 소원은 갖고 싶은 선물 뭐 그런 거 아닌가?","source_cn":"……呃，一般来说，小时候的隆冬节梦想，应该是晚上收到什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA287E03CDEFBE07C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041534608:1":{"text":"물론 향기로운 술과 맛있는 음식으로 가득한 연회, 그리고 화려한 조명과 이어지는 무도회도 말이야!","source_cn":"当然，还有充满了醇酒与美食的盛大晚宴！以及华丽的灯光与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x793714B4D8A1090A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041534609:1":{"text":"누군가에게 이건 한겨울 축제가 아니라 매일매일 이어지는 일상일 것 같은데.","source_cn":"我倒是觉得对有些人来说，这压根谈不上隆冬节的梦想，而是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23C183B6F24B655A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:萨基塔里斯":{"text":"샤키탈리스","source":"萨基塔里斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔琳":{"text":"탈렌","source":"塔琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}